```
Is it possible that `minOverlap` is not equal to any of the four?
No, `Math.min` of those four must be one of them.

Wait! I see it!
`S = 200`.
$x = \text{brick.x} - 8$. $r = 7$.
$x+r = \text{brick.x} - 1$.
Step 0: $x = \text{brick.x} - 8 + 200/60 = \text{brick.x} - 8 + 3.33 = \text{brick.x} - 4.66$.
$x+r = \text{brick.x} + 2.33$.
`collides` is TRUE.
